---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '>城市';
const description = '海南旅游指南2026——59个国家免签证';
const lastUpdated = '2026年6月';
const readTime = '7分钟';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">

    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/visa/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Visa & Entry
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">返回城市指南</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Hainan Travel Guide: China's Tropical Island — No Visa Needed for 59 Countries
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">海南旅游指南：中国热带岛屿——59个国家免签证</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>海滩、雨林、火山和世界级的度假胜地，59个国家的公民可以免签证参观长达30天。</span>
        <span>⏱️ ｛readTime｝</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">快速回答</h2>
      <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-800"><strong>海南是中国的热带岛屿天堂，拥有海滩、雨林、火山和世界级的度假胜地，来自59个国家的公民可以免签证访问海南长达30天。</strong> No tour group needed, no embassy visit required. Fly into Haikou or Sanya with your passport and a return ticket, and you're in.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">This is a big deal if you're from the <strong>美国、墨西哥、菲律宾、印度尼西亚或捷克共和国</strong> — these countries aren'><strong>海南是中国's mainland 30-day visa-free list.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">☀️</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">热带气候</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">全年平均24°C/75°F</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🏖️</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">顶级海滩</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">亚龙湾、大东海、海棠湾</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🌋</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">火山地质公园</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">海口独特的地质</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🌴</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Rainforest</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">五指山、雁塔、霸王岭</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">⛳</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">高尔夫度假村</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">世界级课程</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-1">🦞</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">新鲜海鲜</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">海南以它而闻名</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Which Countries Qualify -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">哪些国家有资格申请海南免签证？</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>59个国家</strong> — and this list includes several countries NOT on the standard mainland China visa-free list, most notably <strong>>你能做什么</strong>.</p>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Region</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Countries</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap">--这些国家不在中国大陆的30天免签证名单上。</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-gray-700">Albania, Austria, Belarus, Belgium, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus, <strong>捷克共和国</strong>丹麦、爱沙尼亚、芬兰、法国、德国、希腊、匈牙利、冰岛、爱尔兰、意大利、拉脱维亚、立陶宛、卢森堡、马耳他、摩纳哥、黑山、荷兰、北马其顿、挪威、波兰、葡萄牙、罗马尼亚、俄罗斯、塞尔维亚、斯洛伐克、斯洛文尼亚、西班牙、瑞典、瑞士、乌克兰、英国</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap">亚洲（11）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-gray-700">Brunei, <strong>Indonesia</strong>, Japan, Kazakhstan, Malaysia, <strong>Philippines</strong>、卡塔尔、新加坡、韩国、泰国、阿拉伯联合酋长国</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap">美洲（6）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-gray-700">Argentina, Brazil, Canada, Chile, <strong>Mexico</strong>, <strong>美国</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap">大洋洲（2）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-gray-700">澳大利亚、新西兰</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="mt-4 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 rounded-r-xl px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
        <strong>密钥：</strong> Countries in <strong>大胆</strong> (like <strong>United States</strong>) are not on China's mainland 30-day visa-free list — Hainan is their best visa-free option.
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <!-- When to Visit -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">何时游览海南</h2>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Month</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Temp</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Rain</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Crowds</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Verdict</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">11月至3月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">20至28摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Low</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">High</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-emerald-600">🌟 最佳时间——干燥、温暖、完美的海滩天气</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">4月至6月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">25-32摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Moderate</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Low</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-amber-600">👍 很好——更热，但游客更少</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">7月至10月</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">26-32摄氏度</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">高（台风季节）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Low</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-red-600">⚠️ 下雨——廉价航班，但请查看台风预报</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>旅游旺季：</strong> Chinese New Year (Jan/Feb) and National Day Golden Week (Oct 1–7) — avoid if you can.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Where to Go -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">海南去哪里</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🏖️ 三亚——海滩中心</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">三亚是大多数游客去的地方。想想棕榈树、白沙和高端度假村。</p>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Beach</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">为什么去</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">亚龙湾</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">岛上最好的海滩。清澈的海水，柔软的沙滩，周围环绕着度假胜地。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">大东海湾</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">更多的当地氛围，更便宜的酒店，海滩上有很多海鲜餐厅。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">海棠湾</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">更安静，更高档。三亚亚特兰蒂斯酒店（水上公园+水族馆）。</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">三亚的其他景点：</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>蜈支洲岛</strong> — day trip for snorkeling and clear water</li>
        <li><strong>南山寺</strong> — 108m Guanyin statue (tallest in the world)</li>
        <li><strong>亚诺达雨林</strong> — jungle hiking with waterfalls</li>
        <li><strong>鹿回头公园</strong> — sunset views over Sanya</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🏛️ 海口——首都</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">更多的文化，更少的海滩。</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Volcanic Geopark</strong> — hike up an extinct volcano crater</li>
        <li><strong>七楼老街</strong> — arcaded buildings from the 1920s, great photo spot</li>
        <li><strong>海南博物馆</strong> — learn about the Li and Miao minority cultures</li>
        <li><strong>观澜湖</strong> — massive resort complex with golf, hot springs, and a film studio theme park</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🗺️ 超越两大城市</h3>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Place</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">为什么访问</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Boao</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">一年一度的亚洲论坛小镇。美丽的海滨公路。<br>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">💡 提示：如果您对尖端的医疗治疗和度假住宿感兴趣，博鳌乐城是中国唯一一个可以获得海外批准的药物和疗法的医疗特区，而这些药物和疗法尚未在大陆上市。</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Wuzhishan</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">“五指山”——岛上最好的徒步旅行</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Xinglong</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">热带植物园+咖啡种植园</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Bawangling</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">野生雨林，珍稀海南长臂猿</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What to Eat -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">海南吃什么</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Dish</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">它是什么</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">必须尝试</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">文昌鸡</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海南最有名的菜。姜葱汁烧鸡。</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">海口的任何一家当地餐馆</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">嘉吉鸭</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">浓汤慢炖鸭肉</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Boao</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">海南面</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">肉汤或干米粉</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">到处都是早餐店</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Seafood</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">新鲜螃蟹、大虾、蛤蜊、鱼——烤或蒸</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">三亚海鲜市场（买新鲜的，他们煮）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">椰浆饭</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">椰奶糯米饭</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">夜市</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Qingbuliang</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">椰奶、豆类、水果、冰甜品汤</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">三亚街头小摊（适合热天）</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Getting Around -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">海南旅游</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li><strong>高速铁路：</strong> Hainan has a circular high-speed rail line that connects Haikou, Boao, Sanya, and most towns. Trains run frequently and are cheap (Haikou → Sanya ~¥100, 1.5 hours).</li>
        <li><strong>出租车/滴滴：</strong> Call a ride easily through the <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">滴滴应用</a> or via Alipay/WeChat mini programs.</li>
        <li><strong>汽车租赁：</strong> Possible with an International Driving Permit + Chinese translation</li>
        <li><strong>公共汽车：</strong> Cheap but slow, routes cover most tourist spots</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Where to Stay -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">住在哪里</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Budget</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Sanya</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Haikou</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">💰 预算（100-200日元）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">大东海地区旅馆</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">七楼地区宾馆</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">💰💰 中档（300-600日元）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">亚龙湾度假区（中档）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">观澜湖地区酒店</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">💰💰💰 保费（¥800+）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">亚特兰蒂斯，Edition，丽思卡尔顿酒店（海棠湾）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">希尔顿、万豪酒店（市中心）</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">海南的度假村通常比东南亚同等质量的度假村便宜。亚龙湾500日元/晚的客房通常包括早餐，并设有私人海滩区。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Visa-Free Rules -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">免签证规则——你需要知道的</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Question</th>
              <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Answer</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我能呆多久？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Up to <strong>30天</strong> — counted from the day after you arrive</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我需要旅行团吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3"><strong>No</strong> — independent solo travelers are fine</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我可以延期吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">可能的话，向海南当地移民局申请</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我可以去中国大陆吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3"><strong>No</strong> — this policy only covers Hainan island</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">我可以进入海南，去香港，然后再回来吗？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">是的——每个条目都会重置30天的时钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">如果我逾期居留怎么办？</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">入学要求：</p>
      <ol class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-700">
        <li>✅ 护照有效期为6+个月</li>
        <li>✅ 30天内回程或续程机票</li>
        <li>✅ 酒店预订（推荐）</li>
        <li>✅ Arrival card (given on the plane or <a href="/zh/visa/arrival-card/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">在线填写</a>)</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Practical Tips -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">海南实用小贴士</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li><strong>使用支付宝或微信支付</strong> — set them up before you fly. Most places in Hainan are cashless. See our <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">如何在中国付款</a> guide.</li>
        <li><strong>仍然需要VPN</strong> — Google, WhatsApp, Instagram won't work without it. <a href="/zh/life/best-vpns/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">设置VPN</a> before you arrive.</li>
        <li><strong>SIM卡/eSIM</strong> — buy one online (airalo, Holafly) or at the airport. See our <a href="/zh/life/best-sim-esim/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">SIM卡指南</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Language</strong> — English is not widely spoken in Hainan outside of resorts. Have Google Translate or Pleco ready.</li>
        <li><strong>防晒霜+驱蚊剂</strong> — both are essentials year-round.</li>
        <li><strong>Tipping</strong> — not expected. See our <a href="/zh/payment/tipping/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">倾翻指南</a>.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

